=   entry .Error   raised when a path cannot be watched
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.98.1`: _the path could not be watched because …_, with one of four reasons:
-         `LimitExceeded` (_the operating system's limit on watched paths has been exceeded_,
-         such as inotify's `max_user_watches`), `Nonexistent` (_the path does not exist_),
-         `NotDirectory` (_the path is not a directory_, as when a watched path's parent is a
-         regular file) and `PermissionDenied` (_the user does not have permission to watch the
-         path_). Raised by `Watch(paths)` and by `open[Watch]` as the registration is made.
+         Errore `↯/s.98.1`: _the path could not be watched because …_, con uno di quattro
+         motivi: `LimitExceeded` (_the operating system's limit on watched paths has been
+         exceeded_, come il `max_user_watches` di inotify), `Nonexistent` (_the path does not
+         exist_), `NotDirectory` (_the path is not a directory_, come quando il genitore di un
+         percorso osservato è un file regolare) e `PermissionDenied` (_the user does not have
+         permission to watch the path_). Sollevato da `Watch(paths)` e da `open[Watch]` al
+         momento della registrazione.

=         path_). Raised by `Watch(paths)` and by `open[Watch]` as the registration is made.
